{"script":"s_5_8_1","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0.4,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1c","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1c","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]浴缸？你们要浴缸做什么？[l][cm]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1c","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]先自我介绍一下，我叫瑟尼，来自索利德山。这次专程来温泉村，就是想向各位请教泡澡的学问，得到世界上最好的浴缸！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]想要浴缸就是为了泡澡，不同形式的浴缸能带来不同的泡澡体验。我在魔爪湖已经尝试过许多浴缸了，现在来到这里就是希望前辈能给我带来全新、至强的泡澡体验！[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1a","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]前辈什么的谈不上，我也只是一个普通的生意人罢了。[l][cm]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]不过看在你这么诚恳的份上，我愿意将我们温泉村的澡盆介绍给你。[l][cm]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1a","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]澡盆？可我想要的是浴缸啊……[l][cm]","charaName":"“浴缸”瑟尼"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1f","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1f","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]霜烬平原大雪封山，可没法像索利德山那样能采到那么多瓷土。不过谁说泡澡就一定要用浴缸呢，用澡盆体验也很不错。[l][cm]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1a","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]三位朋友，可否为我准备5个木板和5个钉子，我这就为这位前来朝圣的“浴缸”信徒打造一个澡盆。[l][cm]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1a","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]5块木板和5个钉子是吧，交给我们吧。我们也想见识一下能媲美浴缸的澡盆呢。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1b","layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1b","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呵呵……放心吧，绝对不会让你们失望的。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"奥格"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara066_1","addImg":"chara066_1_face_chara066_1b","x":300,"y":58,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}],"des":"浴缸之魂-雪域探险家奥格互动"}